<title>UK: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP WORLD GROUP QUALIFYING ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP WORLD GROUP QUALIFYING ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the Davis Cup World</p>
<p>Group qualifying round made on Thursday (x denotes seeding):</p>
<p> Zimbabwe    v x-Austria</p>
<p> x-Brazil    v New Zealand</p>
<p> India	 v x-Chile</p>
<p> Belgium     v x-France</p>
<p> x-Germany   v Mexico</p>
<p> x-Russia    v Romania</p>
<p> Canada	v x-Slovakia</p>
<p>Switzerland v x-South Korea</p>
<p>Matches to be played September 17 to 19.</p>
</text>
